config RAMP
	bool "Ramp library"
	imply FPU if CPU_HAS_FPU
	help
	  Enable a ramp: a slew-rate limiter moving an output toward a
	  target once per step, with separate rates away from and toward 0,
	  one state per handle. Floating-point (float32) implementation:
	  FPU is implied on SoCs that have one, and the application may
	  still disable it.
